# Model Lab — apps/web environment
#
# The canonical, fully documented example lives at the repo root:
#   ../../.env.example
#
# Both locations are loaded (see next.config.ts). Copy the root example to
# <repo>/.env for a shared workspace config, or to apps/web/.env.local when
# you want app-local overrides — the apps/web file wins on conflicts. Every
# variable is server-side only; nothing is NEXT_PUBLIC_.
